1
00:02:00,089 --> 00:02:02,889
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:04,382 --> 00:02:07,922
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

3
00:02:11,284 --> 00:02:13,974
So, you're here for a good thing.

4
00:02:19,075 --> 00:02:20,965
Malhun Hatun.

5
00:02:22,457 --> 00:02:24,017
We...

6
00:02:24,933 --> 00:02:27,173
came here as Umur Bey invited us.

7
00:02:28,841 --> 00:02:30,751
However, he's not here.

8
00:02:33,925 --> 00:02:37,925
We don't know what's going on, Malhun
Hatun.

9
00:02:44,638 --> 00:02:48,178
It looks like you didn't
know that we were coming.

10
00:02:49,096 --> 00:02:52,236
You don't know where Umur Bey is.

11
00:02:57,284 --> 00:03:01,284
It seems he has some work to do.

12
00:03:01,777 --> 00:03:04,037
Or else, he would be here.

13
00:03:05,592 --> 00:03:08,472
Yes, my Sheikh.
He will come.

14
00:03:08,682 --> 00:03:11,102
Then we'll see what is happening.

15
00:03:12,350 --> 00:03:13,610
Whatever.

16
00:03:13,875 --> 00:03:19,435
We can't be here any longer.

17
00:03:20,194 --> 00:03:21,664
My Sheikh.

18
00:03:22,525 --> 00:03:24,345
We should go.

19
00:03:25,193 --> 00:03:27,183
My Sheikh.
He may come any moment.

20
00:03:27,518 --> 00:03:30,668
I am sure he will come.

21
00:03:32,553 --> 00:03:34,913
Osman Bey is right.

22
00:03:35,144 --> 00:03:40,864
We can't wait any longer.

23
00:03:44,417 --> 00:03:48,657
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim. (In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful)

24
00:03:50,042 --> 00:03:53,292
Send our
regards to Umur Bey, Malhun Hatun.

25
00:03:53,941 --> 00:03:59,171
Tell him we
want to hear what he will say about it.

26
00:04:00,269 --> 00:04:03,319
- My Sheikh.
- My Sheikh.

27
00:04:36,503 --> 00:04:37,823
My Bey.

28
00:04:39,334 --> 00:04:40,654
My Bey.

29
00:04:41,218 --> 00:04:43,468
Nikola still isn't here.

30
00:04:44,583 --> 00:04:50,383
My Bey. I am afraid that
Nikola may do something bad.

31
00:04:50,661 --> 00:04:52,921
Why would he do that, Bahadır?

32
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,260
He hates Togay as much as I do.

33
00:04:57,492 --> 00:05:00,182
Why would he endanger his own prosperity?

34
00:05:01,384 --> 00:05:04,954
He will come.
He will definitely come.

35
00:05:09,163 --> 00:05:15,443
The price of the betrayal is paid with
a sacrifice.

36
00:05:30,377 --> 00:05:31,977
Where are you, father?

37
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,709
Where are you?

38
00:06:00,032 --> 00:06:02,612
My Bey, he's still not here.
What will we do?

39
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:08,740
We can't go back, Bahadır.

40
00:06:09,157 --> 00:06:12,537
Look at the way where
Nikola will come from.

41
00:06:12,806 --> 00:06:17,026
We will deal with him if he's not there.

42
00:06:17,842 --> 00:06:22,282
We can sacrifice our lives if we should.

43
00:06:22,887 --> 00:06:26,207
Your command, my Bey.
Come on.

44
00:06:29,063 --> 00:06:32,623
My Allah, help us.

45
00:06:44,086 --> 00:06:46,466
It's a trap!

46
00:06:47,101 --> 00:06:49,521
Be careful!

47
00:06:49,637 --> 00:06:52,787
It's a trap!
Stay together Alps!

48
00:07:13,869 --> 00:07:15,459
Togay!

49
00:07:15,911 --> 00:07:18,711
The hunter becomes the hunted, Umur Bey.

50
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:23,270
Alps!

51
00:07:23,416 --> 00:07:24,686
Attack!

52
00:08:03,405 --> 00:08:05,845
Mongols are coming!

53
00:10:09,543 --> 00:10:13,543
For blood, for the love of blood...

54
00:10:13,952 --> 00:10:16,052
to Erlik Khan.

55
00:11:09,393 --> 00:11:13,063
Their dead bodies are for Erlik Khan!

56
00:11:13,612 --> 00:11:19,322
Don't have mercy on them!
Kill them all!

57
00:13:12,335 --> 00:13:15,785
I finally found you, Umur Bey.

58
00:13:16,734 --> 00:13:19,424
I'll cut your bloody hands, Togay!

59
00:13:40,322 --> 00:13:45,692
I'll give your soul to Erlik Khan.

60
00:13:59,970 --> 00:14:01,800
Togay!
Archers!

61
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:24,540
My Allah, what have I done?

62
00:14:42,843 --> 00:14:45,813
Kill them!
Kill them all!

63
00:15:00,767 --> 00:15:03,007
You came back quickly, my Osman.

64
00:15:03,549 --> 00:15:06,169
How are Umur Bey and Malhun Hatun?

65
00:15:09,081 --> 00:15:10,781
Umur Bey wasn't there.

66
00:15:12,905 --> 00:15:15,285
We didn't talk about anything.

67
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:18,530
Should I set a table for you?

68
00:15:21,039 --> 00:15:23,069
I am not hungry, my Bala.

69
00:15:25,124 --> 00:15:27,824
Okay, then.
I'll go back to working.

70
00:16:28,037 --> 00:16:31,657
That's enough!
Let's go!

71
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:42,540
Mother.

72
00:18:33,369 --> 00:18:34,739
Help me.

73
00:19:55,325 --> 00:19:56,975
Let me look at you.

74
00:19:57,299 --> 00:19:58,619
Come here.

75
00:20:01,193 --> 00:20:03,433
Don't be afraid.

76
00:20:28,470 --> 00:20:29,920
Alaca.

77
00:20:30,882 --> 00:20:34,972
Put out the fire.
Start the treatments of the wounded.

78
00:20:35,094 --> 00:20:38,314
First, children.
Children are primary.

79
00:20:55,883 --> 00:20:57,063
Father.

80
00:20:58,133 --> 00:21:00,103
Where are you, father?

81
00:21:00,648 --> 00:21:02,298
Where are you?

82
00:21:21,093 --> 00:21:24,403
Umur Bey's story has ended.

83
00:21:24,463 --> 00:21:26,313
We are leaving!

84
00:21:36,555 --> 00:21:39,095
Why did he do that?

85
00:21:39,446 --> 00:21:42,716
Why did he invite us if he was reluctant?

86
00:21:43,021 --> 00:21:45,941
Why did he leave if he was eager?

87
00:21:47,055 --> 00:21:49,595
There's something wrong, Bamsı Bey.

88
00:21:49,736 --> 00:21:52,416
It will be out soon.

89
00:21:52,644 --> 00:21:55,994
- Do you think something bad happened?
- I hope not.

90
00:21:56,464 --> 00:21:59,484
However, I can't think of anything
other than that.

91
00:21:59,608 --> 00:22:02,628
- Can I come in?
- Come in.

92
00:22:19,088 --> 00:22:22,568
My Bey, we have news from Umur Bey.

93
00:22:23,125 --> 00:22:24,345
Tell me.

94
00:22:24,949 --> 00:22:26,289
My Bey.

95
00:22:27,096 --> 00:22:28,596
Camu.

96
00:22:29,276 --> 00:22:31,686
He attacked our tent.

97
00:22:32,078 --> 00:22:34,118
What are you saying?

98
00:22:35,366 --> 00:22:39,896
My Bey, they attacked Umur Bey too.

99
00:22:42,243 --> 00:22:44,973
Togay attacked our Bey too.

100
00:22:45,191 --> 00:22:48,061
How is Umur Bey? How is Malhun Hatun?
Tell me.

101
00:22:48,275 --> 00:22:50,615
They are alive and well.

102
00:22:55,314 --> 00:22:56,874
Thank Allah.

103
00:22:57,254 --> 00:22:59,364
Thank Allah.

104
00:23:00,129 --> 00:23:02,619
We have lost so many people, Osman Bey.

105
00:23:02,826 --> 00:23:04,836
They broke us.

106
00:23:08,308 --> 00:23:11,478
- They ruined us.
- Ssssh.

107
00:23:13,244 --> 00:23:15,614
Don't lower your head.

108
00:23:17,054 --> 00:23:19,614
We will take their revenge.

109
00:23:19,848 --> 00:23:24,588
We will take revenge of the Alps
that fought with Umur Bey...

110
00:23:24,634 --> 00:23:26,454
and innocent people who are attacked.

111
00:23:26,541 --> 00:23:29,791
May Allah bless you, Osman Bey.

112
00:23:42,245 --> 00:23:45,265
Didn't we deal with Togay?

113
00:23:45,924 --> 00:23:49,284
Liars don't keep their
promises, Osman Bey.

114
00:24:00,250 --> 00:24:01,870
- Göktuğ.
- My Bey.

115
00:24:01,932 --> 00:24:05,102
Boran.
Get ready.

116
00:24:05,166 --> 00:24:09,986
- We are going to Umur Bey's tent.
- Your command, my Bey.

117
00:24:13,436 --> 00:24:14,946
Bamsı Bey.

118
00:24:15,474 --> 00:24:18,754
We won't be trapped.
You say here.

119
00:24:18,934 --> 00:24:21,234
Take some precautions.

120
00:24:21,436 --> 00:24:26,146
It seems that Togay won't
stick to the agreement.

121
00:24:26,964 --> 00:24:28,924
Don't worry, Osman Bey.

122
00:24:29,011 --> 00:24:33,011
I will kill them if they come here.

123
00:24:34,965 --> 00:24:37,665
Brother.
Come on.

124
00:24:38,214 --> 00:24:40,214
Come on, brother.

125
00:25:59,053 --> 00:26:01,203
What have I done, Bahadır?

126
00:26:02,165 --> 00:26:04,125
What have I done?

127
00:26:05,911 --> 00:26:07,571
I was fooled.

128
00:26:10,961 --> 00:26:16,261
I became a victim of the desire of revenge
that possessed my soul.

129
00:26:18,504 --> 00:26:21,554
My Alps...

130
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:25,870
women, innocent children...

131
00:26:27,643 --> 00:26:29,953
I am the only guilty one.

132
00:26:30,233 --> 00:26:31,763
Only me.

133
00:26:38,476 --> 00:26:39,776
Father.

134
00:26:40,591 --> 00:26:42,451
You are wounded.

135
00:26:43,475 --> 00:26:46,195
I was fooled by Nikola.

136
00:26:47,756 --> 00:26:50,606
It was a trick of him saying we would
kill Togay together.

137
00:26:50,696 --> 00:26:52,836
Togay knew that.

138
00:26:52,965 --> 00:26:59,465
He raided my unprotected tent.

139
00:27:05,488 --> 00:27:09,488
Open your eyes, Gökçe.
Gökçe!

140
00:27:14,371 --> 00:27:19,011
My Bey! What did they do to us?

141
00:27:21,056 --> 00:27:23,816
She is dying!

142
00:28:16,519 --> 00:28:19,759
Father.
Let me look at your wound.

143
00:28:20,698 --> 00:28:23,688
My wound is in...

144
00:28:24,570 --> 00:28:26,670
my heart.

145
00:28:30,657 --> 00:28:32,997
There's no cure for it.

146
00:29:10,064 --> 00:29:14,064
Victory!
Victory! Victory!

147
00:29:40,916 --> 00:29:42,426
Umur Bey.

148
00:29:42,730 --> 00:29:45,080
He won't be able to recover.

149
00:29:45,553 --> 00:29:47,453
Osman is next.

150
00:29:47,801 --> 00:29:50,701
Geyhatu's judge...

151
00:29:51,343 --> 00:29:53,183
what about his order?

152
00:29:53,446 --> 00:29:56,766
He will understand he can't make himself
listened to the Turks...

153
00:29:56,847 --> 00:29:59,547
by giving orders from the palace.

154
00:29:59,754 --> 00:30:02,564
I am the owner of this region.

155
00:30:02,784 --> 00:30:04,984
Umur Bey learned his lesson.

156
00:30:05,040 --> 00:30:08,280
He won't tie us down anymore.

157
00:30:11,928 --> 00:30:13,518
Umur Bey...

158
00:30:14,725 --> 00:30:18,755
does he do this without telling Osman?

159
00:30:23,072 --> 00:30:24,482
Osman...

160
00:30:24,804 --> 00:30:27,804
I have just one agreement with you.

161
00:30:28,796 --> 00:30:29,886
And that is...

162
00:30:30,676 --> 00:30:31,916
death.

163
00:30:32,158 --> 00:30:36,158
Victory!

164
00:30:45,183 --> 00:30:47,423
Osman Bey is here.

165
00:31:46,594 --> 00:31:48,574
I am sorry, sisters and brothers.

166
00:31:50,051 --> 00:31:51,591
Brother.

167
00:31:51,859 --> 00:31:55,639
- You will be fine.
- Thank you, Osman Bey.

168
00:32:43,888 --> 00:32:48,488
- She will be okay, Inshallah.
- Inshallah.

169
00:33:17,641 --> 00:33:19,311
Umur Bey.

170
00:33:20,314 --> 00:33:22,084
Malhun Hatun.

171
00:33:23,778 --> 00:33:28,258
Your pain is our pain, your
sorrow is our sorrow.

172
00:33:29,899 --> 00:33:31,949
I am sorry for your losses.

173
00:33:32,708 --> 00:33:37,048
The martyrs' graves show that...

174
00:33:37,752 --> 00:33:42,222
these lands are yours forever.

175
00:33:43,312 --> 00:33:47,312
However, we will take their revenge.

176
00:33:49,224 --> 00:33:51,514
Thank you, Osman Bey.

177
00:33:53,931 --> 00:33:57,491
Tell me.
How did they do it?

178
00:34:03,092 --> 00:34:07,192
They raided our tent after you
left with Sheikh Edebali.

179
00:34:18,201 --> 00:34:19,941
Umur Bey.

180
00:34:22,240 --> 00:34:26,380
You weren't in the tent
when we came here.

181
00:34:29,205 --> 00:34:31,995
Togay took advantage of it.

182
00:34:36,481 --> 00:34:40,861
A dispute happened
between the herdsmen and Byzantine

183
00:34:41,131 --> 00:34:44,791
because of the grass.

184
00:34:46,825 --> 00:34:49,915
I went there to understand what happened.

185
00:34:55,985 --> 00:34:58,815
Our agreement with Togay doesn't
make any sense anymore.

186
00:34:59,059 --> 00:35:01,459
You be careful.

187
00:35:01,639 --> 00:35:05,879
I left my Alps here for the tent's safety.

188
00:35:06,824 --> 00:35:09,154
Don't worry.

189
00:35:09,852 --> 00:35:12,332
Thank you, Osman Bey.

190
00:35:17,097 --> 00:35:18,617
Umur Bey...

191
00:35:19,194 --> 00:35:21,114
get some rest.

192
00:35:22,625 --> 00:35:25,155
I will come here again later.

193
00:35:26,154 --> 00:35:29,144
Thank you, Osman Bey.

194
00:36:54,162 --> 00:36:56,632
Is your father dead too?

195
00:37:08,668 --> 00:37:11,198
I never had a father.

196
00:37:14,379 --> 00:37:18,059
My mother and my father is...

197
00:37:22,070 --> 00:37:23,680
my tent.

198
00:37:29,410 --> 00:37:31,550
So is yours.

199
00:37:31,861 --> 00:37:35,451
You will have a Bey. You will have
children.

200
00:37:38,005 --> 00:37:40,265
The honor of your father...

201
00:37:40,999 --> 00:37:43,729
you will carry it with your children.

202
00:37:51,877 --> 00:37:53,597
Proudly.

203
00:38:01,899 --> 00:38:03,809
When...

204
00:38:04,387 --> 00:38:07,527
the tears fell to the lands...

205
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:11,310
hope will grow in those lands.

206
00:38:18,422 --> 00:38:21,922
Selcan and Bala will be exiled.

207
00:38:22,062 --> 00:38:23,012
Father.

208
00:38:23,268 --> 00:38:28,228
- How will you treat me as your father?
- When you start to behave like my father!

209
00:38:31,380 --> 00:38:35,550
I am not your daughter!
You are not my father!

210
00:38:35,785 --> 00:38:40,875
I said you can kill him
even if the traitor is my father.

211
00:38:41,378 --> 00:38:44,918
Whatever the traditions say
should be done.

212
00:39:10,178 --> 00:39:13,618
We disturbed the balances
as we didn't go to war.

213
00:39:13,828 --> 00:39:17,828
War is like a balance.

214
00:39:21,662 --> 00:39:23,812
My plan is working.

215
00:39:24,918 --> 00:39:26,998
We will have great news.

216
00:39:27,421 --> 00:39:29,431
Our actual enemy is Togay.

217
00:39:29,572 --> 00:39:32,442
We would kill him if we went to war.

218
00:39:32,525 --> 00:39:36,545
My soldiers are alive.
My enemies' soldiers are...

219
00:39:38,335 --> 00:39:39,915
killing each other.

220
00:39:40,078 --> 00:39:43,908
We should have attacked Togay
when Umur Bey was with us.

221
00:39:44,787 --> 00:39:46,357
Umur Bey...

222
00:39:47,658 --> 00:39:50,948
Togay must have killed him.

223
00:39:59,013 --> 00:40:01,533
Nikola, we have some news.

224
00:40:02,087 --> 00:40:06,877
Togay destroyed Umur's army and his tent.

225
00:40:08,924 --> 00:40:13,494
What were we saying? The actual war
starts now!

226
00:40:15,507 --> 00:40:18,127
Osman's promise...

227
00:40:18,996 --> 00:40:20,286
is spoiled.

228
00:40:20,537 --> 00:40:24,187
Umur will hope for help from Osman.

229
00:40:24,969 --> 00:40:28,449
And Osman will attack Togay.

230
00:40:28,665 --> 00:40:33,145
What if Osman doesn't attack Togay?

231
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:35,430
Then...

232
00:40:41,241 --> 00:40:44,171
Togay will attack Osman.

233
00:40:45,832 --> 00:40:48,372
Then, what will we do?

234
00:40:48,827 --> 00:40:54,047
Without losing a soldier...

235
00:40:54,254 --> 00:40:59,974
we will watch them kill each other.

236
00:41:02,207 --> 00:41:04,407
When their war is over...

237
00:41:04,837 --> 00:41:07,727
we will be done with...

238
00:41:07,893 --> 00:41:09,293
the rest of the bugs.

239
00:41:09,473 --> 00:41:12,333
All of them!

240
00:41:23,186 --> 00:41:26,386
Why didn't Togay stick to the agreement?

241
00:41:26,852 --> 00:41:29,752
There's something behind it.

242
00:41:30,322 --> 00:41:33,542
Togay isn't trustworthy.

243
00:41:33,702 --> 00:41:38,272
As he doesn't need a reason
to not keep his word.

244
00:41:39,859 --> 00:41:41,629
We will be ready.

245
00:41:41,756 --> 00:41:46,036
He won't stop as he attacked Umur Bey.

246
00:41:46,734 --> 00:41:50,734
However, there may be...

247
00:41:51,720 --> 00:41:55,520
another reason for him
to not keep his word.

248
00:41:55,836 --> 00:41:58,556
We should learn this.

249
00:41:59,422 --> 00:42:01,806
Brother, how are the preparations going?

250
00:42:01,806 --> 00:42:05,133
We are taking precautions around Sögüt
and the tents.

251
00:42:05,133 --> 00:42:08,173
We are ready for a sudden attack.

252
00:42:08,173 --> 00:42:09,259
Eyvallah (okay).

253
00:42:09,273 --> 00:42:12,503
We still keep working to extend
precautions, Osman Bey.

254
00:42:12,503 --> 00:42:14,283
Osman Bey...

255
00:42:14,692 --> 00:42:19,072
sooner or later, the thing
behind all this will be apparent.

256
00:42:19,072 --> 00:42:23,607
If we are sure that Togay will attack...

257
00:42:23,607 --> 00:42:26,617
why don't we attack first?

258
00:42:27,422 --> 00:42:30,342
Togay has more soldiers than before.

259
00:42:32,217 --> 00:42:33,427
And...

260
00:42:34,910 --> 00:42:38,150
He can predict our attack.

261
00:42:40,386 --> 00:42:44,156
The outcome of attacking a prepared
and crowded enemy...

262
00:42:44,971 --> 00:42:46,901
can be heavy.

263
00:42:47,526 --> 00:42:51,726
You are right, Osman Bey, but...

264
00:42:51,813 --> 00:42:56,383
That we are just watching while
he attacks Umur Bey...

265
00:42:56,586 --> 00:42:58,836
may show us weak.

266
00:42:58,936 --> 00:43:01,186
It may encourage the enemy.

267
00:43:01,721 --> 00:43:04,611
It may let our friends down.

268
00:43:04,870 --> 00:43:07,960
We will wait Togay to make a mistake.

269
00:43:08,310 --> 00:43:13,050
When the conditions are satisfied...

270
00:43:14,175 --> 00:43:19,315
We raise our flag and say
Takbir (Allah is the greatest).

271
00:43:20,852 --> 00:43:22,682
Inshallah. (If Allah permits).

272
00:43:23,558 --> 00:43:25,168
Mashallah. (Praises).

273
00:44:08,103 --> 00:44:10,203
I've made a mistake.

274
00:44:13,761 --> 00:44:18,681
I paid dearly for my mistake.

275
00:44:19,727 --> 00:44:22,127
This was a painful warning.

276
00:44:23,198 --> 00:44:27,588
My Lord tells me I'm taking the
wrong way...

277
00:44:30,148 --> 00:44:32,498
My daughter tells the same.

278
00:44:35,452 --> 00:44:39,882
Her eyes tell me I'm taking
the wrong way...

279
00:44:41,739 --> 00:44:44,379
Tells me that I've destroyed everything.

280
00:44:47,544 --> 00:44:49,714
You are taking the wrong way, father.

281
00:44:49,949 --> 00:44:51,869
You've made a mistake.

282
00:44:52,683 --> 00:44:55,813
You still keep doing it.

283
00:44:59,970 --> 00:45:02,840
I heard while you were talking to Bahadır.

284
00:45:02,977 --> 00:45:05,847
I know you left the tent to attack Togay.

285
00:45:06,508 --> 00:45:09,628
This is why Togay attacked our tent,
right?

286
00:45:12,322 --> 00:45:14,602
We made a plan with Nicola.

287
00:45:16,139 --> 00:45:18,159
But he left me alone.

288
00:45:19,093 --> 00:45:21,383
He wanted to...

289
00:45:23,784 --> 00:45:26,374
bait us to Togay.

290
00:45:27,466 --> 00:45:32,736
Trusting Nicola aside, doing all of these
without telling Osman Bey was also wrong.

291
00:45:33,705 --> 00:45:37,605
Now it is a worse mistake that
you are hiding it from Osman Bey.

292
00:45:42,337 --> 00:45:44,957
I lost so many soldiers...

293
00:45:45,938 --> 00:45:47,628
The innocents...

294
00:45:50,976 --> 00:45:53,976
They even slaughtered the innocents.

295
00:46:06,037 --> 00:46:10,687
My Bey, Osman Bey has to know it was us
who attacked Togay.

296
00:46:12,707 --> 00:46:16,417
This means his agreement with Togay
has been violated.

297
00:46:18,724 --> 00:46:22,264
His tribe is under danger.
He needs to take precaution.

298
00:46:24,694 --> 00:46:25,844
Today...

299
00:46:27,535 --> 00:46:29,975
I was going to talk to him...

300
00:46:31,864 --> 00:46:34,444
but I couldn't...

301
00:46:36,252 --> 00:46:39,322
I didn't want to embrass myself
to Osman Bey...

302
00:46:39,655 --> 00:46:43,405
while our pain was fresh.

303
00:46:44,618 --> 00:46:47,398
I couldn't take it.

304
00:46:48,570 --> 00:46:53,037
But, the first thing to do tomorrrow is...

305
00:46:53,337 --> 00:46:55,727
to talk Osman Bey about this.

306
00:47:00,352 --> 00:47:02,112
Malhun.

307
00:47:03,546 --> 00:47:05,736
What is Gokce's situation?

308
00:47:10,109 --> 00:47:12,699
She is still fighting for her life.

309
00:47:30,132 --> 00:47:33,252
We placed observes on the ways.

310
00:47:33,543 --> 00:47:36,903
We placed archers everywhere.

311
00:47:42,218 --> 00:47:44,441
What about the bridges?

312
00:47:44,441 --> 00:47:46,536
Two has been made unusable.

313
00:47:46,536 --> 00:47:49,746
The ways Togay can take has been decreased
in number.

314
00:47:53,435 --> 00:47:57,645
We'll try to end them before coming here.

315
00:47:57,730 --> 00:48:01,740
But if they manage to come here,
we'll have the final strike here.

316
00:48:03,378 --> 00:48:09,308
Kayı Tribe is ready to fight.
Now I want to see Sogut.

317
00:48:12,937 --> 00:48:14,867
My Bey.

318
00:48:17,634 --> 00:48:19,534
- Tell me, Baysungur.
- My Bey...

319
00:48:19,551 --> 00:48:24,321
A Mongol soldier was carrying a chest.

320
00:48:24,321 --> 00:48:26,461
He left the chest when our observers
chased him.

321
00:48:35,976 --> 00:48:37,806
Open it.

322
00:48:57,325 --> 00:48:59,165
Take it my Bey.

323
00:49:08,551 --> 00:49:10,651
It is from Togay.

324
00:49:12,188 --> 00:49:15,098
He said our agreement was violated...

325
00:49:18,118 --> 00:49:21,078
when Umur Bey tried to attack him.

326
00:49:24,523 --> 00:49:30,973
He says its my and Kayı tribe's turn.

327
00:49:43,950 --> 00:49:50,260
All the ambition, all the vanity
led him a huge mistake like this.

328
00:49:53,846 --> 00:49:59,136
If this is true...

329
00:50:00,373 --> 00:50:02,163
Then...

330
00:50:03,676 --> 00:50:06,936
this means he disobeyed me.

331
00:50:12,539 --> 00:50:15,469
I'll make him pay for this.

332
00:50:16,632 --> 00:50:20,152
I'll make him pay for this.

333
00:50:28,684 --> 00:50:32,954
You don't need to go to him, Osman Bey.

334
00:50:33,652 --> 00:50:35,742
Here they are coming.

335
00:50:39,173 --> 00:50:41,763
Let him come.

336
00:50:43,118 --> 00:50:45,418
Let him come.

337
00:50:54,092 --> 00:50:56,052
Salam Aleikum
(peace be upon you)

338
00:50:56,458 --> 00:51:00,038
Aleikum Salam.
(Peace be upon you too.)

339
00:51:00,648 --> 00:51:03,188
Aleikum Salam.
(Peace be upon you too.)

340
00:51:06,674 --> 00:51:11,464
Osman Bey, we have to talk about
something important.

341
00:51:14,781 --> 00:51:17,631
Come here Umur Bey.

342
00:51:17,992 --> 00:51:20,472
Come here.

343
00:52:06,408 --> 00:52:09,658
Umur Bey.
Is this true?

344
00:52:10,703 --> 00:52:12,483
Tell me.

345
00:52:31,045 --> 00:52:32,805
It is true.

346
00:52:35,481 --> 00:52:37,691
What the hell are you saying?

347
00:52:47,305 --> 00:52:49,105
Umur Bey...

348
00:52:49,524 --> 00:52:51,184
we shall go to my tent.

349
00:52:53,133 --> 00:52:55,903
I can hardly hide my anger.

350
00:53:02,304 --> 00:53:04,134
Let's go.

351
00:53:04,593 --> 00:53:06,153
Brother.

352
00:53:07,386 --> 00:53:10,296
I'll make you pay in my tent.

353
00:53:14,968 --> 00:53:18,228
Malhun Hatun.
You shall not come.

354
00:53:22,355 --> 00:53:24,785
I'll see Umur Bey face to face.

355
00:53:57,383 --> 00:53:59,352
I didn't know.

356
00:53:59,352 --> 00:54:04,072
We are aware, Malhun Hatun.
Don't worry.

357
00:54:04,721 --> 00:54:10,891
Let Beys talk it through.
We consent you.

358
00:54:12,659 --> 00:54:14,899
We consent you.

359
00:54:19,198 --> 00:54:22,268
I hope everything goes well.

360
00:54:22,846 --> 00:54:24,856
Inshallah
(If Allah permits)

361
00:54:35,712 --> 00:54:38,152
I give my condolences to you, Malhun Hatun

362
00:54:39,264 --> 00:54:41,448
I heard what happened.

363
00:54:41,448 --> 00:54:43,828
May Allah bless you, thanks Bala Hatun.

364
00:54:44,207 --> 00:54:46,097
Thank Lord you are fine.

365
00:54:46,213 --> 00:54:48,243
My Allah protected me.

366
00:54:53,246 --> 00:54:57,516
That Togay and Osman Bey's agreement
is violated doesn't bode well.

367
00:54:58,771 --> 00:55:01,391
There's something wrong in this.

368
00:55:04,898 --> 00:55:08,048
Come, have a rest.

369
00:55:19,196 --> 00:55:21,696
We came to your tent yesterday.

370
00:55:23,413 --> 00:55:29,523
With my Sheik Edebalı
and my brother Gündüz.

371
00:55:31,831 --> 00:55:36,921
We waited for you to keep your
promise and come.

372
00:55:39,179 --> 00:55:41,439
But you didn't show up.

373
00:55:43,908 --> 00:55:46,008
Where were you?

374
00:56:03,858 --> 00:56:06,658
Where were you?

375
00:56:44,174 --> 00:56:46,841
Didn't we warn you...

376
00:56:46,841 --> 00:56:50,161
not to get in action alone?

377
00:56:52,722 --> 00:56:58,862
Didn't you troubled us each time?

378
00:57:01,776 --> 00:57:05,306
You still do what you want to do, huh?

379
00:57:14,433 --> 00:57:17,383
You lost many alps.

380
00:57:18,854 --> 00:57:21,944
You took many innocents' life.

381
00:57:22,853 --> 00:57:26,843
You endangerd all the Turks!

382
00:57:28,881 --> 00:57:33,321
For what?
Tell me Umur Bey.

383
00:57:34,212 --> 00:57:36,082
Why?

384
00:57:45,017 --> 00:57:47,617
I told you I agreed with Sultan.

385
00:57:47,801 --> 00:57:51,991
We set a plan!
You destroyed it all!

386
00:57:52,659 --> 00:57:57,989
I found myself confronting Ilhanlı State
without the support I expected to have!

387
00:58:07,911 --> 00:58:10,001
Tell me.

388
00:58:12,910 --> 00:58:15,400
Tell me.

389
00:58:17,906 --> 00:58:23,296
What is the cost of that?

390
00:58:24,216 --> 00:58:26,146
Tell me.

391
00:58:28,927 --> 00:58:34,517
What is that bow for, Osman Bey?

392
00:58:37,070 --> 00:58:39,580
Don't you remember this bow?

393
00:58:41,513 --> 00:58:47,783
The bow my ancestor Oghuz Khan gave
to his son Günhan.

394
00:58:51,079 --> 00:58:55,869
Don't you still understand that...

395
00:58:56,612 --> 00:59:01,052
Günhan, the noble Kayıs are the
heir of this gifted state?

396
00:59:02,164 --> 00:59:04,364
Tell me!

397
00:59:08,406 --> 00:59:12,486
I told you to stand behind this bow,
not to face this bow!

398
00:59:31,166 --> 00:59:33,166
You are right.

399
00:59:33,689 --> 00:59:35,539
You are right.

400
00:59:36,097 --> 00:59:38,047
Osman Bey.

401
00:59:39,186 --> 00:59:42,936
I didn't stand behind that bow.

402
00:59:44,741 --> 00:59:48,011
I faced it.

403
00:59:52,793 --> 00:59:54,123
Now...

404
00:59:57,004 --> 01:00:00,374
I am drawing back.

405
01:00:03,599 --> 01:00:09,009
Now that I am nothing but a hamper
to you...

406
01:00:11,360 --> 01:00:14,290
What to do is clear now.

407
01:00:19,708 --> 01:00:26,165
We will go back just like how we came.

408
01:00:33,394 --> 01:00:37,784
We are going to leave this land.

409
01:00:47,388 --> 01:00:50,158
This is the best call.

410
01:02:05,862 --> 01:02:08,011
We shall leave, Bala Hatun.

411
01:02:08,011 --> 01:02:10,491
You can go, Malhun Hatun.

412
01:02:22,719 --> 01:02:26,459
What happened there?
What did Osman Bey say?

413
01:02:26,932 --> 01:02:30,982
He mentioned Oghuz Khan's golden bow.

414
01:02:32,138 --> 01:02:36,168
We are leaving Malhun.
Get ready.

415
01:03:08,187 --> 01:03:10,777
Umur Bey seems perished.

416
01:03:11,856 --> 01:03:17,086
There must have been a conflict
about merging the tribes.

417
01:03:17,219 --> 01:03:19,879
Malhun Hatun is sad too.

418
01:03:22,227 --> 01:03:24,597
I wonder what's going to happen
to marriage.

419
01:03:31,019 --> 01:03:34,269
You have to ask this to Osman Bey,
my Gonca.

420
01:03:45,205 --> 01:03:47,405
Can I come in Osman Bey?

421
01:03:47,876 --> 01:03:49,966
Come!

422
01:03:58,834 --> 01:04:01,234
What is it, Osman Bey?

423
01:04:01,823 --> 01:04:06,315
What did Umur Bey say?
Does he realise his fault?

424
01:04:06,315 --> 01:04:09,655
Will he give up on disobeying you?

425
01:04:10,944 --> 01:04:12,264
Umur Bey...

426
01:04:15,046 --> 01:04:17,946
won't be with us anymore.

427
01:04:21,679 --> 01:04:26,839
Osman Bey, were you holding this
bow while talking to Umur Bey?

428
01:04:30,524 --> 01:04:34,924
I mentioned my ancestor Oghuz Khan.

429
01:04:36,837 --> 01:04:39,347
He understood what I meant.

430
01:04:48,616 --> 01:04:51,806
Now, forget about Umur Bey.

431
01:04:52,302 --> 01:04:54,522
Let's talk about Togay.

432
01:04:55,732 --> 01:04:58,042
However you like, Osman Bey.

433
01:04:58,099 --> 01:05:00,969
Togay's plan is clear.

434
01:05:01,056 --> 01:05:04,398
He'll hold us responsible for
Umur Bey's attack.

435
01:05:05,168 --> 01:05:09,018
And he is going to want to
do the same to us.

436
01:05:09,120 --> 01:05:15,270
Then he'll see attacking Umur Bey is not
the same with attacking Kayı.

437
01:05:16,844 --> 01:05:19,584
Of course he will!

438
01:05:19,719 --> 01:05:25,176
If he comes here in our tent,
I'll rip his liver out..

439
01:05:25,556 --> 01:05:28,066
I'll feed wolves with his body!

440
01:05:28,066 --> 01:05:33,556
That day will arrive, Osman Bey.
We'll see that dog die.

441
01:05:33,556 --> 01:05:34,886
Eyvallah.

442
01:05:35,004 --> 01:05:39,314
No one can stop your dream.

443
01:06:00,981 --> 01:06:02,921
I swear.

444
01:06:03,838 --> 01:06:07,218
- We swear.
- We swear.

445
01:06:07,610 --> 01:06:10,270
Let everyone hear that.

446
01:06:20,440 --> 01:06:23,600
There are three parts of Kayı security.

447
01:06:24,755 --> 01:06:27,245
We can surpass them.

448
01:06:28,294 --> 01:06:32,918
- What about Sogut?
- They placed troops inside and outside.

449
01:06:32,918 --> 01:06:36,034
Every troop includes twenty Alps,
excluding watchmen.

450
01:06:36,034 --> 01:06:39,594
Osman Bey doubled the number of
soldiers today.

451
01:06:39,844 --> 01:06:43,574
And there are wandering Alps who
check around. We have to watch out for them.

452
01:06:44,937 --> 01:06:51,277
So, Osman is trying to hide his fear
by taking precautions.

453
01:06:54,522 --> 01:06:59,772
He'll see precautions he took won't
save him from dying.

454
01:07:05,676 --> 01:07:09,356
- Talk.
- Osman recieved your gift.

455
01:07:11,532 --> 01:07:15,192
Osman is frightened.

456
01:07:16,679 --> 01:07:20,219
He is going to be mad.

457
01:07:20,681 --> 01:07:26,871
While he is busy with managing his
feelings, I'll strike him big time.

458
01:07:28,743 --> 01:07:30,783
What is your order, Togay?

459
01:07:31,309 --> 01:07:33,669
Divide the soldiers into two.

460
01:07:33,854 --> 01:07:39,744
We are going to attack both their tents
and Sogut simultaneously.

461
01:07:40,533 --> 01:07:45,673
We are going to infiltrate around their
tent before sunshine.

462
01:07:45,694 --> 01:07:49,944
While twilight turns into red,
when they recite adhan...

463
01:07:50,207 --> 01:07:53,607
and start praying to their God...

464
01:07:54,735 --> 01:07:59,375
we'll let them reach to their God.

465
01:08:01,066 --> 01:08:05,966
Now leave and be ready
to slaughter anyone.

466
01:08:21,549 --> 01:08:23,619
In the name of dark forests...

467
01:08:24,003 --> 01:08:26,433
Dark souls...

468
01:08:26,623 --> 01:08:28,523
And dark...

469
01:08:29,921 --> 01:08:31,941
swears...

470
01:08:37,146 --> 01:08:41,566
The breath of death shall be with us.

471
01:08:41,744 --> 01:08:43,244
My dark swear

472
01:08:45,052 --> 01:08:46,352
shall get wet...

473
01:08:50,772 --> 01:08:53,442
by Osman's blood!

474
01:09:10,173 --> 01:09:12,793
We took precautions.

475
01:09:12,915 --> 01:09:17,205
If Togay comes here, he won't
be able to get out of here alive.

476
01:09:19,980 --> 01:09:25,470
I can't wait to fight. I would pray them
to come if it was just us.

477
01:09:35,107 --> 01:09:37,157
I'll join you later.

478
01:09:45,043 --> 01:09:48,273
- What is it?
- He is investigating how people are doing

479
01:09:52,283 --> 01:09:53,763
Oh...

480
01:09:56,132 --> 01:09:59,792
Sorry...
I didn't mean to scare you.

481
01:10:00,064 --> 01:10:02,944
I am not scared.
I am just surprised.

482
01:10:03,027 --> 01:10:05,237
You came out of nowhere.

483
01:10:09,176 --> 01:10:11,596
Why are you looking like that?

484
01:10:13,388 --> 01:10:15,068
Your eyes...

485
01:10:17,382 --> 01:10:19,632
What's it?

486
01:10:21,763 --> 01:10:24,503
Looks worried.

487
01:10:24,836 --> 01:10:27,706
Mongols are going to attack, that's why.

488
01:10:28,466 --> 01:10:32,686
Don't you see I'm here?
Why are you scared?

489
01:10:35,044 --> 01:10:37,464
What does it mean that you are here?

490
01:10:42,627 --> 01:10:46,207
You are in safe if I'm here.

491
01:10:49,457 --> 01:10:51,957
Only me?

492
01:10:52,417 --> 01:10:55,777
We have other Alps, are.
Everybody is in safe.

493
01:11:05,370 --> 01:11:07,030
Aygül wait.

494
01:11:13,693 --> 01:11:16,173
This is for protecting me.

495
01:11:37,815 --> 01:11:41,045
Do you see Goktug over there?

496
01:11:41,998 --> 01:11:44,028
I do, so what?

497
01:11:45,378 --> 01:11:47,728
He is in love.

498
01:11:48,253 --> 01:11:50,623
What makes you say that?

499
01:11:53,824 --> 01:11:55,774
Isn't it apparent?

500
01:11:59,938 --> 01:12:02,638
Observing people is a shame.

501
01:12:03,845 --> 01:12:06,095
We should mind our own business.

502
01:12:08,333 --> 01:12:10,523
I want to watch them.

503
01:12:10,523 --> 01:12:13,443
Cerkutay! Cerkutay!

504
01:12:14,891 --> 01:12:16,841
That's it.

505
01:12:16,941 --> 01:12:19,301
I am a girl without father and mother.

506
01:12:20,248 --> 01:12:22,678
I am a Greek living in Sogut alone.

507
01:12:22,925 --> 01:12:26,255
I make my living by selling fruits.

508
01:12:30,294 --> 01:12:32,994
Eat. They are fresh.

509
01:12:33,825 --> 01:12:35,575
Of course they are.

510
01:12:38,104 --> 01:12:41,204
Why don't you taste?
Are you shy?

511
01:12:43,814 --> 01:12:48,294
He is shy.
My brother is a bit shy.

512
01:12:50,473 --> 01:12:53,103
Cerkutay, what are you doing here?

513
01:12:53,759 --> 01:12:56,919
Aygül insisted to see you.

514
01:12:59,021 --> 01:13:01,071
Aygül!

515
01:13:01,926 --> 01:13:05,256
- I can eat if you don't.
- Cerkutay.

516
01:13:06,637 --> 01:13:09,567
- Give me.
- Cerkutay!

517
01:13:22,244 --> 01:13:25,104
Aygül, eat it. It's delicious.

518
01:13:31,346 --> 01:13:34,771
- Leave.
- We shall leave.

519
01:13:37,871 --> 01:13:39,981
Cerkutay.

520
01:13:43,203 --> 01:13:45,293
Cerkutay.

521
01:13:45,821 --> 01:13:47,251
Walk!

522
01:13:49,389 --> 01:13:51,389
Cerkutay.

523
01:13:59,211 --> 01:14:01,281
They are both crazy.

524
01:14:10,011 --> 01:14:13,181
I must go.

525
01:14:16,365 --> 01:14:18,365
My mission is waiting.

526
01:14:20,334 --> 01:14:22,224
I'll see you around.

527
01:14:24,711 --> 01:14:26,561
I shall leave.

528
01:15:03,444 --> 01:15:05,834
Check it if you can rip it.

529
01:15:14,102 --> 01:15:17,882
- The stitches are very hard, my Sheik.
- We can't, my Sheik.

530
01:15:22,287 --> 01:15:26,747
If it rips out someday, it'll start
from here.

531
01:15:28,283 --> 01:15:30,583
Where it was stitched.

532
01:15:46,385 --> 01:15:48,705
Salam Aleikum my Sheik.

533
01:15:51,578 --> 01:15:53,864
Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

534
01:15:53,864 --> 01:15:57,854
Alaikum Salam.
Excuse us, my Sheik.

535
01:16:09,348 --> 01:16:11,658
Sit, Osman Bey.

536
01:16:23,454 --> 01:16:27,354
My Sheik, you probably know the topic.

537
01:16:28,809 --> 01:16:31,429
I do, Osman Bey, I do.

538
01:16:32,288 --> 01:16:35,488
While I was waiting to set a peace
in my tent...

539
01:16:36,160 --> 01:16:41,240
He attacked Togay to ruin
our agreement.

540
01:16:43,935 --> 01:16:50,155
My Sheik, he ruined everything!
It'll cost so many people's life!

541
01:16:59,833 --> 01:17:02,693
Stitching leather is difficult, Osman Bey.

542
01:17:04,819 --> 01:17:09,409
Stitching two different leathers
is difficult.

543
01:17:23,949 --> 01:17:26,489
Cutting it is easy.

544
01:17:30,982 --> 01:17:36,222
Disconnecting them is easy.

545
01:17:40,635 --> 01:17:44,245
You wanted to do the difficult.

546
01:17:45,671 --> 01:17:49,581
Umur Bey chose the easy.

547
01:17:58,435 --> 01:18:02,555
However, there is one other possibility.

548
01:18:05,030 --> 01:18:08,360
Starting over...

549
01:18:08,889 --> 01:18:13,699
Stitching it one more time with patience.

550
01:18:20,618 --> 01:18:25,668
You may say "why would I bear again?"

551
01:18:31,459 --> 01:18:37,419
Only the one whose aim is great
can bear it again.

552
01:18:39,861 --> 01:18:45,491
Only that man can reunite everything
again.

553
01:19:06,482 --> 01:19:09,042
Osman Bey is right.

554
01:19:09,464 --> 01:19:12,124
We ruined everything.

555
01:19:12,848 --> 01:19:15,128
We paid dearly.

556
01:19:15,974 --> 01:19:18,634
We can't stay here anymore.

557
01:19:18,684 --> 01:19:20,604
We'll migrate.

558
01:19:24,384 --> 01:19:30,824
We'll seek Kızılbeyogulları's future
in other lands.

559
01:19:31,954 --> 01:19:34,314
Where are we going to migrate, father?

560
01:19:35,333 --> 01:19:38,482
This is the end.
We are on the edge.

561
01:19:38,482 --> 01:19:42,172
Greeks on one side,
Mongols on the other. Where is to migrate?

562
01:19:45,050 --> 01:19:48,560
Wherever possible.
I can't stay here.

563
01:19:48,701 --> 01:19:55,741
You have to. We have to help Osman Bey
to carry his responbilities.

564
01:19:58,333 --> 01:20:02,193
We are the ones who ruined everything.

565
01:20:03,392 --> 01:20:09,192
Now we can't help him.
We are weakened.

566
01:20:09,330 --> 01:20:13,050
And our reputation is shaken.

567
01:20:13,050 --> 01:20:16,740
Our immigration is
the best for Osman Bey.

568
01:20:18,349 --> 01:20:23,229
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come in.

569
01:20:26,449 --> 01:20:30,449
What's wrong, Alaca?
Had something happened?

570
01:20:31,069 --> 01:20:33,939
My bey.

571
01:20:37,599 --> 01:20:41,599
Gökçe has passed.

572
01:20:53,071 --> 01:20:57,071
Leave me alone.

573
01:21:19,161 --> 01:21:23,161
The price of this mistake...

574
01:21:24,616 --> 01:21:29,196
can't be paid by the others,
Umur Bey.

575
01:22:05,612 --> 01:22:09,612
They ruined your plan again, right?

576
01:22:15,426 --> 01:22:20,146
Isn't it possible for the two tribes
to unite now?

577
01:22:26,939 --> 01:22:33,759
How can I be together with the people
who act behind me.

578
01:22:36,712 --> 01:22:42,132
He'll take his tribe and leave.
Let him do so.

579
01:22:49,804 --> 01:22:54,614
What about Malhun Hatun.

580
01:22:55,176 --> 01:22:59,176
She will go with him, of course.

581
01:23:04,952 --> 01:23:08,952
May the outcome be good, Osman Bey.

582
01:23:09,451 --> 01:23:14,061
You did everything you could
for this union.

583
01:23:20,288 --> 01:23:24,948
But I failed.

584
01:24:20,399 --> 01:24:25,749
My intentions are honest.
Accept me, my Allah.

585
01:24:28,336 --> 01:24:33,056
The one who gives the trouble also
gives the cure.

586
01:24:34,160 --> 01:24:38,930
Here, heart wounds are
getting treated...

587
01:24:38,930 --> 01:24:42,140
and pain gets eased.

588
01:24:42,140 --> 01:24:49,390
-Is there a cure for regret?
-There is no cure for those who don't regret.

589
01:24:49,710 --> 01:24:52,630
Come with your regret.

590
01:25:01,326 --> 01:25:08,796
The Mongol heathens don't show mercy to
even the women or children.

591
01:25:08,796 --> 01:25:12,796
When will they leave, my sheik?

592
01:25:13,206 --> 01:25:17,206
There is goodness in every evil.

593
01:25:17,725 --> 01:25:21,725
Maybe the beys who caused...

594
01:25:21,725 --> 01:25:25,725
those innocent people to die...

595
01:25:25,725 --> 01:25:31,355
will understand their responsibilities
better and come together.

596
01:25:32,701 --> 01:25:36,701
Maybe they will understand that...

597
01:25:36,701 --> 01:25:40,701
the future of the Muslims depend
on this union.

598
01:25:41,558 --> 01:25:48,448
Then, the Mongol heathens will leave
as they come.

599
01:26:04,420 --> 01:26:10,350
My sheik, Umur Bey wants to come in.

600
01:26:15,462 --> 01:26:19,462
Let him come, Akça Dervish.

601
01:26:55,382 --> 01:26:58,862
I should leave, my sheik.

602
01:27:07,703 --> 01:27:11,393
Come, Umur Bey.

603
01:27:27,380 --> 01:27:30,640
My sheik.

604
01:27:32,978 --> 01:27:36,838
I've made a mistake.

605
01:27:37,256 --> 01:27:42,579
Because of my mistake...

606
01:27:44,649 --> 01:27:48,649
children...
Even children died.

607
01:27:52,749 --> 01:27:58,209
At this height...

608
01:27:59,643 --> 01:28:02,573
Gökçe...

609
01:28:05,933 --> 01:28:12,053
She was so pretty and nimble...

610
01:28:13,732 --> 01:28:17,412
They killed her even.

611
01:28:20,723 --> 01:28:26,583
Because of me...
Because of my ambitions...

612
01:28:28,745 --> 01:28:33,245
I'm the cause of everything.

613
01:28:37,030 --> 01:28:42,770
Now it's enough.
Neither Osman Bey...

614
01:28:44,011 --> 01:28:47,571
nor the Turkmen Beys...

615
01:28:48,367 --> 01:28:52,367
can't get no good from me.

616
01:28:54,429 --> 01:28:58,429
-I should just leave--
-How easy it is...

617
01:28:58,429 --> 01:29:03,669
to just leave, to give up...

618
01:29:03,669 --> 01:29:08,799
to say that you failed.
What about...

619
01:29:10,611 --> 01:29:15,371
the hard thing to do?

620
01:29:16,685 --> 01:29:22,835
Admitting that you made a mistake.
Feeling regret.

621
01:29:22,835 --> 01:29:26,835
Taking lessons.

622
01:29:27,019 --> 01:29:31,019
When you are at this stage...

623
01:29:31,019 --> 01:29:35,019
when you saw the results
of your ambitions...

624
01:29:35,019 --> 01:29:40,389
got a great lesson,
you can't leave.

625
01:29:40,641 --> 01:29:44,641
What should I do, my sheik?

626
01:29:44,730 --> 01:29:49,490
I can't look at anyone in the face.

627
01:29:49,490 --> 01:29:56,730
You won't think selfishly.
You will join Osman Bey's union.

628
01:29:57,242 --> 01:30:03,702
You will do your part and find
forgiveness.

629
01:30:06,786 --> 01:30:11,696
Turks have no other place to imigrate
to.

630
01:30:11,887 --> 01:30:16,717
We'll stay here and not move.

631
01:30:17,635 --> 01:30:22,335
Understand this well.

632
01:30:59,364 --> 01:31:05,884
Our warriors positioned near Söğüt and
Kayı Tribe. We are ready to attack.

633
01:31:07,004 --> 01:31:11,724
The spirits of twilight will offer
blood...

634
01:31:11,724 --> 01:31:17,364
at dawn in the Kayı Tribe
and Söğüt!

635
01:31:17,364 --> 01:31:23,804
When Turks perform salaat
for their god...

636
01:31:23,804 --> 01:31:29,924
the earth will tremble and
the sky will rain blood.

637
01:31:37,598 --> 01:31:45,808
My warriors will have the spoils of
the tribe and Söğüt!

638
01:31:48,258 --> 01:31:54,208
Osman and his wife are mine.

639
01:31:54,208 --> 01:31:59,098
The gold and the virgins are yours.

640
01:32:04,514 --> 01:32:11,324
For my black oath!
Erlik Khan! Erlik Khan!

641
01:32:20,597 --> 01:32:25,267
Where are you father?
''Gökçe has passed away.''

642
01:32:29,462 --> 01:32:33,302
Leave me alone.

643
01:32:38,585 --> 01:32:42,185
Where did you go?

644
01:32:57,749 --> 01:33:01,749
Where is Umur Bey, I wonder.

645
01:33:03,461 --> 01:33:07,461
He went after the ones who
seek the help of a candle...

646
01:33:07,461 --> 01:33:12,011
when there is the great sun
to benefit.

647
01:33:12,479 --> 01:33:16,999
He seeks the cure of regret
in a greater regret.

648
01:33:43,508 --> 01:33:45,958
Malhun Hatun, where are you going?

649
01:33:45,958 --> 01:33:50,658
I'm going to Osman Bey. I'm afraid
my father might act on his own.

650
01:34:11,113 --> 01:34:15,623
-What is this governor doing here?
-If not to drink blood...

651
01:34:16,422 --> 01:34:21,152
may the dark souls curse him.

652
01:35:08,927 --> 01:35:13,957
The stripes on your face
have the color of blood.

653
01:35:13,957 --> 01:35:19,637
Geyhatu's hunting dog, Togay the Dark
Shaman, where are you going?

654
01:35:19,637 --> 01:35:25,447
It's time for the black oath.
Osman broke the agreement.

655
01:35:25,447 --> 01:35:30,047
He sent Umur Bey after me.

656
01:35:30,047 --> 01:35:36,727
I'm blessed with my black oath.
I'm ready to soak Bythinia in blood.

657
01:35:36,727 --> 01:35:40,727
My warriors seek blood like
hungry wolves.

658
01:35:40,727 --> 01:35:44,727
The honor belongs
to Geyhatu.

659
01:35:49,682 --> 01:35:56,342
Draw your warriors back, Togay.
This attack won't happen.

660
01:35:56,342 --> 01:36:03,282
Geyhatu's honor is enough to
fill the seas of the world.

661
01:36:03,512 --> 01:36:07,632
What we need is gold.

662
01:36:07,632 --> 01:36:13,892
Osman did not only break our agreement
but also stained my honor.

663
01:36:15,552 --> 01:36:19,162
I know everything.

664
01:36:19,162 --> 01:36:24,712
You gave a lesson to Umur Bey and his
tribe. He was punished.

665
01:36:24,712 --> 01:36:28,462
More of it will cause a rebellion.

666
01:36:28,462 --> 01:36:32,712
It's not the time for a rebellion.

667
01:36:32,712 --> 01:36:38,512
We assigned you to assure stability
in these lands. Don't harm it.

668
01:36:42,237 --> 01:36:46,237
Where did you learn all this?

669
01:36:46,237 --> 01:36:51,657
My eyes and ears are sharper
than your weapon, Togay.

670
01:36:53,593 --> 01:36:59,323
The punishment I gave Umur Bey is
giving Osman Bey strength. I can't allow it.

671
01:37:07,568 --> 01:37:13,668
You are a border bey! And I'm Geyhatu's
governor.

672
01:37:13,668 --> 01:37:19,058
You will obey my word, Togay.

673
01:37:58,448 --> 01:38:05,628
My black oath awaits. But Osman won't
wait.

674
01:38:05,628 --> 01:38:11,348
A day will come and Osman will
find power in your silence...

675
01:38:11,658 --> 01:38:16,928
and then you will answer.

676
01:38:22,916 --> 01:38:26,916
I'll think about that when the time comes.

677
01:38:26,916 --> 01:38:31,436
Now, I've come from far.
Bring me food.

678
01:38:33,346 --> 01:38:38,036
I've other places to go.

679
01:39:09,279 --> 01:39:14,119
-Take care of the tribe, Gonca.
-Don't worry. Everything is fine.

680
01:39:14,119 --> 01:39:17,009
-I'm going to our sheik.
-Send him my regards.

681
01:39:22,394 --> 01:39:26,394
-Malhun Hatun is coming.
-What's wrong?

682
01:39:36,204 --> 01:39:40,244
-Welcome, Malhun Hatun.
-Thank you, Bala Hatun.

683
01:39:40,244 --> 01:39:43,784
-What's wrong, you look worried?
-I'm here to talk to Osman Bey.

684
01:39:43,784 --> 01:39:46,674
Osman Bey isn't at the tribe.

685
01:39:46,674 --> 01:39:51,894
Where is he? Do you know?
I need to see Osman Bey.

686
01:39:51,894 --> 01:39:56,474
I don't know where he went. If something
is wrong, tell me. Maybe I can help.

687
01:40:00,191 --> 01:40:05,251
Thank you, Bala Hatun. But no other
than Osman Bey can help.

688
01:40:12,172 --> 01:40:18,052
-Malhun Hatun, what happened?
-He isn't here. Bala Hatun doesn't know where.

689
01:40:18,383 --> 01:40:25,023
-What will we do now?
-We'll return. We might hear something there.

690
01:40:25,088 --> 01:40:29,088
We can't leave the tribe empty
in such times.

691
01:40:29,730 --> 01:40:33,730
We don't know what Togay will do.

692
01:41:01,573 --> 01:41:03,673
Come on.

693
01:41:44,263 --> 01:41:48,263
I know your anger for him, Togay!

694
01:41:48,263 --> 01:41:52,263
Geyhatu trusts you. Don't lose
in your anger.

695
01:41:53,619 --> 01:42:00,129
I'm not mad at him, Camuha. How did he
hear what happened so soon?

696
01:42:03,575 --> 01:42:07,575
There is a spy among us.

697
01:42:07,915 --> 01:42:15,315
I will find him and skin his head.

698
01:42:18,994 --> 01:42:22,324
Umur Bey is coming, Togay.

699
01:43:02,081 --> 01:43:07,111
How did you dare to face me, Umur Bey?

700
01:43:07,111 --> 01:43:13,541
You've been chasing me for a long time.
I wanted to settle our scores.

701
01:43:13,781 --> 01:43:18,591
I came to kill you with my own weapon.

702
01:43:18,591 --> 01:43:24,341
Know that Osman Bey isn't involved
in what happened.

703
01:43:24,651 --> 01:43:29,631
I came here to settle scores.

704
01:43:30,403 --> 01:43:35,783
You came to offer your corpse to me.

705
01:43:37,380 --> 01:43:42,160
Your bravery comes from your stupidity.

706
01:43:43,063 --> 01:43:47,063
Give Umur Bey his sword.

707
01:43:56,428 --> 01:44:01,228
If he can kill me, let him go.

708
01:44:16,540 --> 01:44:22,420
What good is a jar that wasn't wet
with tears for?

709
01:44:37,190 --> 01:44:40,620
Thank Allah.

710
01:44:40,620 --> 01:44:45,420
I get to see my dear more frequently.

711
01:44:49,029 --> 01:44:53,029
Would a physician say that to
his patient, my sheik?

712
01:44:53,029 --> 01:44:58,359
My dear is sick again.

713
01:44:58,359 --> 01:45:03,589
She is here again. Thank Allah.
Would he say that?

714
01:45:04,398 --> 01:45:08,398
He wouldn't, Bala.

715
01:45:08,398 --> 01:45:14,358
''Thank Allah, the sick came for a cure''
he would say.

716
01:45:15,474 --> 01:45:19,474
Is there a cure for my sickness, my sheik?

717
01:45:20,982 --> 01:45:24,982
What did Osman tell you, Bala?

718
01:45:24,982 --> 01:45:28,982
Did he say that it won't happen if you
don't want?

719
01:45:30,574 --> 01:45:36,754
-He did.
-But you accepted it.

720
01:45:37,742 --> 01:45:41,742
After all, you care about Osman
and the tribe...

721
01:45:43,530 --> 01:45:51,090
and all the Muslim world, more than
you care about yourself.

722
01:45:51,834 --> 01:45:57,154
Would your god deny such altruism?

723
01:46:06,406 --> 01:46:11,186
Do you know the devotion of our
mother Sare?

724
01:46:11,552 --> 01:46:14,722
I know, my sheik.

725
01:46:14,847 --> 01:46:18,847
To have Hz.İbrahim's lineage
live...

726
01:46:18,847 --> 01:46:23,887
she consented him to marry
another woman.

727
01:46:24,995 --> 01:46:28,995
Then, what happened?

728
01:46:28,995 --> 01:46:32,995
Allah blessed them with...

729
01:46:32,995 --> 01:46:36,995
a good child.

730
01:46:37,626 --> 01:46:43,936
Our mother Sare was infertile.

731
01:46:43,936 --> 01:46:47,936
And she was old.

732
01:46:48,532 --> 01:46:54,122
My daughter, you prayed a lot.
You were patient.

733
01:46:55,499 --> 01:47:00,489
Now, stay patient during this test.

734
01:47:00,766 --> 01:47:07,216
Allah sees you and hears you.

735
01:47:15,616 --> 01:47:20,956
My sheik, will Allah bless me
with a child?

736
01:47:22,020 --> 01:47:29,930
Will I be a mother?
Will I hug my children?

737
01:47:32,867 --> 01:47:38,307
Surely, Allah hears our prayers.

738
01:48:14,098 --> 01:48:18,098
You wanted to kill me with your
sword, huh?

739
01:48:23,607 --> 01:48:30,847
Then, I will kill you with your own
sword.

740
01:50:39,205 --> 01:50:44,695
Your daughter Malhun won't be able
to go to your grave.

741
01:50:44,695 --> 01:50:49,385
Ravens will eat your corpse!

742
01:50:59,023 --> 01:51:01,813
Protect Togay!

743
01:51:49,648 --> 01:51:55,068
We didn't come here to spill blood
but to remind you our agreement.

744
01:52:03,864 --> 01:52:07,034
Move!

745
01:52:54,625 --> 01:52:58,625
Umur Bey not only disrespected me...

746
01:52:59,423 --> 01:53:03,633
but you too. He will pay.

747
01:53:07,549 --> 01:53:12,259
He paid enough.

748
01:53:12,941 --> 01:53:18,141
Umur Bey and his tribe is under
my protection.

749
01:53:19,251 --> 01:53:24,431
In our laws, it's on me to punish
him.

750
01:53:24,648 --> 01:53:29,998
It's not that easy, Osman Bey.
Not that easy.

751
01:53:31,216 --> 01:53:35,216
Know it well that...

752
01:53:35,216 --> 01:53:41,946
I won't leave a bey under my protection
to you to punish!

753
01:53:48,724 --> 01:53:53,494
If something happens to Umur Bey...

754
01:53:54,231 --> 01:53:58,231
then, our agreement is over.

755
01:54:06,864 --> 01:54:12,037
We made an agreement. I will become
a vassal...

756
01:54:12,037 --> 01:54:16,437
and you will get the gold.

757
01:54:20,348 --> 01:54:24,348
As Genghis Khan said...

758
01:54:25,097 --> 01:54:29,967
Either honor the agreement or the
law of the land...

759
01:54:29,970 --> 01:54:32,450
to death.

760
01:54:42,388 --> 01:54:48,718
Genghis Khan's laws on one side...

761
01:54:49,031 --> 01:54:53,731
and Togay's anger on the other
side.

762
01:54:54,550 --> 01:54:59,620
Which one will Geyhatu pick?
Tell me.

763
01:55:18,944 --> 01:55:22,944
Your tongue is as sharp as your sword.

764
01:55:22,944 --> 01:55:26,944
But not as my sword.

765
01:55:26,944 --> 01:55:30,944
When the time comes...

766
01:55:31,253 --> 01:55:35,253
I will unsheathe it for you.

767
01:55:35,253 --> 01:55:39,253
Know that well, Osman Bey.

768
01:56:13,357 --> 01:56:17,997
Now we'll freely leave here.

769
01:56:18,715 --> 01:56:25,425
I want to believe that you have the
honor to not stab us on our backs.

770
01:56:31,026 --> 01:56:32,922
Umur Bey.

771
01:57:02,437 --> 01:57:05,897
Osman.

772
01:57:05,897 --> 01:57:10,977
Back then, when I went to invade
China...

773
01:57:10,977 --> 01:57:15,917
there was a bey with a tongue as
sharp as yours at Wuhan.

774
01:57:15,917 --> 01:57:21,957
I locked him in a well until he died.

775
01:57:25,431 --> 01:57:30,011
Do you know why?

776
01:57:31,249 --> 01:57:35,249
The salvation for rebel souls
like you...

777
01:57:36,382 --> 01:57:40,212
is death.

778
01:57:46,231 --> 01:57:50,231
My god is a witness...

779
01:57:50,231 --> 01:57:55,011
we are able to get out of the
wells we are locked in.

780
01:58:35,188 --> 01:58:40,108
-You did the right thing, Togay.
-Osman thinks that he has won.

781
01:58:41,444 --> 01:58:45,544
I will give him such a death that...

782
01:58:45,544 --> 01:58:51,356
it will be more merciless than
a dark well.

783
01:59:11,307 --> 01:59:13,797
Osman Bey.

784
01:59:20,661 --> 01:59:24,181
Come, Umur Bey.

785
01:59:31,667 --> 01:59:35,667
Thank you, Osman Bey.
What I did there--

786
01:59:35,667 --> 01:59:41,267
What you did there was an
honorable act.

787
01:59:42,139 --> 01:59:47,999
You wanted to pay with your life
for your mistake.

788
01:59:48,055 --> 01:59:57,905
But I can never allow a Turkmen bey
to walk to death.

789
02:00:00,366 --> 02:00:04,836
You are a man of your word, Osman Bey.

790
02:00:04,836 --> 02:00:08,836
You neither give up your sword
nor your brothers.

791
02:00:09,289 --> 02:00:16,169
You don't let your flag go down,
not let Muslims to get hurt.

792
02:00:16,169 --> 02:00:20,169
Not at all.
Not at all.

793
02:00:21,706 --> 02:00:27,186
Now, I'm not against you.

794
02:00:28,758 --> 02:00:34,668
If you allow me, I want to stand
with you.

795
02:00:59,288 --> 02:01:06,308
Osman Bey, how did you know that
I would go to Togay?

796
02:01:10,417 --> 02:01:14,997
-What's wrong, Kumral Abdal?
-You decide, Osman Bey.

797
02:01:15,115 --> 02:01:21,045
-Tell me then.
-I saw Umur Bey in my dream.

798
02:01:21,045 --> 02:01:26,525
He was like a wounded bird. He flew away
at the dawn without speaking to anyone.

799
02:01:26,787 --> 02:01:30,787
-To where?
-Wait, Osman Bey.

800
02:01:30,787 --> 02:01:36,197
I went after the bird. He entered the
forest. Then, he dissappeared.

801
02:01:36,696 --> 02:01:42,586
-For what?
-Like he was going to pay a price.

802
02:01:42,738 --> 02:01:48,088
-He must've gone to Togay.
-Togay...

803
02:01:48,440 --> 02:01:51,490
Togay will kill him.

804
02:01:51,490 --> 02:01:54,030
Kumral Abdal is our light.

805
02:01:54,435 --> 02:01:59,665
Thank Allah. Thank Allah, he was right.

806
02:02:05,992 --> 02:02:08,862
-Osman Bey.
-Brother.

807
02:02:08,862 --> 02:02:13,232
I need to take some of the alps and
go to the tribe.

808
02:02:16,072 --> 02:02:21,162
Go at once, brother.
I can't trust anyone.

809
02:02:21,367 --> 02:02:26,147
I will accompany Umur Bey.

810
02:02:26,434 --> 02:02:30,004
Alright.

811
02:02:31,351 --> 02:02:35,831
-Thank you, valiants, for not leaving us.
-Thank you, Umur Bey.

812
02:02:37,793 --> 02:02:42,023
-Thank you.
-Disputes are temporal, Umur Bey.

813
02:02:42,023 --> 02:02:44,233
Our brotherhood is permanent.

814
02:02:45,342 --> 02:02:48,322
-Osman Bey.
-Brother.

815
02:02:48,322 --> 02:02:52,322
Come on, alps. We are going to the
tribe.

816
02:03:02,256 --> 02:03:06,256
Umur Bey.

817
02:03:19,866 --> 02:03:26,526
Gather all the alps. We'll search every
place if we have to.

818
02:03:27,356 --> 02:03:31,356
Anyone hears anything about
my father?

819
02:03:31,356 --> 02:03:37,466
Unfortunately, my lady. Alps searched
everywhere but there is no sign.

820
02:03:38,236 --> 02:03:43,216
Where are you, father?
Where are you?

821
02:04:05,102 --> 02:04:09,102
Where were you, father?
I was worried.

822
02:04:09,274 --> 02:04:13,274
Osman Bey will be our guest.

823
02:04:15,587 --> 02:04:19,587
We'll talk there.

824
02:05:04,492 --> 02:05:07,942
Please, sit.

825
02:05:21,004 --> 02:05:28,084
I went to talk to Togay to
solve our issue.

826
02:05:28,250 --> 02:05:32,800
Why did you do that, father?
How can you trust him?

827
02:05:33,015 --> 02:05:37,875
-Couldn't you think that he might kill you?
-I have, my daughter.

828
02:05:38,209 --> 02:05:42,609
I have. But...

829
02:05:42,687 --> 02:05:46,687
I went there to pay for the mistake
I've made.

830
02:05:46,827 --> 02:05:50,827
Did you go there to die?

831
02:05:52,608 --> 02:05:56,608
I didn't want more innocent people...

832
02:05:56,608 --> 02:06:00,608
to get hurt because of me.

833
02:06:02,414 --> 02:06:06,414
And how did you get out?

834
02:06:07,561 --> 02:06:11,561
When Togay was about to kill me...

835
02:06:11,561 --> 02:06:15,561
Osman Bey came and saved me.

836
02:06:21,275 --> 02:06:25,275
Thank you, Osman Bey.

837
02:06:25,275 --> 02:06:30,545
Our debt is increasing. I don't know
how we can pay.

838
02:06:31,367 --> 02:06:36,647
We did our duty. There is no need
to talk about that now.

839
02:06:40,421 --> 02:06:45,141
Togay issue is closed for a while.

840
02:06:45,141 --> 02:06:50,131
Now, it's time to talk about
our future.

841
02:06:55,250 --> 02:06:59,250
Will we still migrate in this
condition, my bey?

842
02:06:59,250 --> 02:07:03,250
There is no need to talk about
that either.

843
02:07:03,250 --> 02:07:07,900
Now, we are together.

844
02:07:08,170 --> 02:07:13,280
No one will go anywhere.

845
02:07:17,100 --> 02:07:22,780
Osman Bey is right, my daughter.
There is no separation now.

846
02:07:22,780 --> 02:07:27,870
I see now who has the future
of the Turks.

847
02:07:36,131 --> 02:07:42,351
Now, the matter of marriage...

848
02:07:42,798 --> 02:07:47,738
that we talked with our sheik.

849
02:07:57,258 --> 02:08:03,998
Malhun Hatun is not only my daughter
but also my right hand.

850
02:08:04,188 --> 02:08:08,368
She carries the weight of the tribe.

851
02:08:08,368 --> 02:08:12,368
She fights when needed.

852
02:08:12,698 --> 02:08:17,448
Her marriage and seperation
from our tribe...

853
02:08:18,047 --> 02:08:22,937
will take our strenght away.

854
02:08:25,435 --> 02:08:31,195
Of course, she will marry and
leave one day.

855
02:08:32,372 --> 02:08:36,372
But...

856
02:08:36,591 --> 02:08:40,591
I'm not sure...

857
02:08:40,591 --> 02:08:46,061
if that's the day, if I'm ready.

858
02:08:59,268 --> 02:09:06,268
I believe, I will never be ready.

859
02:09:16,750 --> 02:09:19,720
Osman Bey.

860
02:09:21,359 --> 02:09:26,859
You shouldn't wait for me to be ready.

861
02:09:28,399 --> 02:09:32,819
If you still want my daughter...

862
02:09:34,103 --> 02:09:40,143
your marriage with Malhun Hatun...

863
02:09:44,152 --> 02:09:48,152
is an honor for me.

864
02:09:54,093 --> 02:09:59,023
Now, tell me, Malhun Hatun.

865
02:09:59,754 --> 02:10:04,444
Do you have your consent for
this marriage.

866
02:10:14,015 --> 02:10:18,875
You say that it's an honor for you to have
your daughter marry him, father.

867
02:10:18,875 --> 02:10:23,495
An honor indeed.
But...

868
02:10:25,625 --> 02:10:29,625
Osman Bey is already married.

869
02:10:32,654 --> 02:10:36,654
There is a woman who waits
for her at his tribe.

870
02:10:39,271 --> 02:10:43,271
You are talking about the merge
of two tribes.

871
02:10:44,309 --> 02:10:48,669
But you don't mention the two
wives coming together.

872
02:10:58,862 --> 02:11:03,812
It seems that Bala Hatun hardened
her heart and accepted it.

873
02:11:12,475 --> 02:11:15,735
And about me...

874
02:11:18,673 --> 02:11:22,673
for the well-being of two
great Turkmen tribes...

875
02:11:24,707 --> 02:11:28,707
going to a tribe that already
has a Khatun...

876
02:11:36,887 --> 02:11:40,627
is something I can accept.

877
02:11:46,959 --> 02:11:52,529
But tell me, Osman Bey.
How will you assure justice?

878
02:11:57,002 --> 02:12:03,122
My first wife and the mother
of my heir...

879
02:12:03,371 --> 02:12:07,661
will stay in different tents.

880
02:12:08,454 --> 02:12:12,574
Their incomes will be separated.

881
02:12:13,882 --> 02:12:19,932
They'll choose their own servants.

882
02:12:22,863 --> 02:12:25,603
But...

883
02:12:28,073 --> 02:12:33,553
no one, and no one...

884
02:12:34,691 --> 02:12:38,691
will order each other.

885
02:12:43,409 --> 02:12:47,409
How will Bala Hatun see me?

886
02:12:52,028 --> 02:12:58,838
You can't expect a woman to...

887
02:12:58,945 --> 02:13:02,545
love another woman that
comes after her.

888
02:13:02,545 --> 02:13:06,545
But she'll show respect.

889
02:13:07,170 --> 02:13:11,170
And she'll expect respect.

890
02:13:20,747 --> 02:13:24,747
Is the only reason you want me...

891
02:13:24,747 --> 02:13:28,747
the interests of these two tribes?

892
02:13:29,291 --> 02:13:33,291
Isn't there any other reason?

893
02:13:35,246 --> 02:13:39,246
Of course.

894
02:13:39,848 --> 02:13:43,968
Of course, there is one more reason.

895
02:13:45,744 --> 02:13:50,784
Kayı Beys expect an heir from me.

896
02:13:51,888 --> 02:13:56,958
And they asked me to marry again.

897
02:13:58,304 --> 02:14:05,554
But I waited to meet the mother of
my heir.

898
02:14:07,177 --> 02:14:12,967
-I waited to find her.
-Have you found her, Osman Bey?

899
02:14:19,684 --> 02:14:23,284
I have.

900
02:14:25,928 --> 02:14:29,328
Indeed I have.

901
02:14:36,710 --> 02:14:41,820
With Allah's approval and the prophet's
words...

902
02:14:45,136 --> 02:14:49,136
will you be my Khatun?

903
02:15:04,724 --> 02:15:07,894
I will.